{"job_id":"F-a03fc573d32e75a1458d","family_id":"F-a03fc573d32e75a1458d","title":"식품위생 분야 종사자의 건강진단 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":20,"target_id":"1f8d0829ef267c3782bfc19df50ad69115317707a9534fde62579aaef0a8002a","source_hash":"6e774cf607888247fa0abb712c3a53b6409d04f447a8f0b04947325faa8a38e8","text":"食品卫生工作者健康检查规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":73,"target_id":"59cab14be7b985cda07fbcb1aba4ed103380916d2cdb3132225d6ec08beb05b0","source_hash":"b06cae374f0e0dc64cccd580aa8be02bf781ffb2a9a81836eb4ca5c3b634faa4","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定根据《食品卫生法》第40条第1款和第4款实施健康检查所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":73,"end":530,"target_id":"fdb2e0e3174c024a72d700c0b658f1557b01e9b13dbe43b6c78dd9e5ee7b99b7","source_hash":"31b2c263688cec0fb6aa4fcbcc2ad5b64c5a2b8aff886969ac846971485bcff4","text":"第二条（健康检查项目等）\n① 根据《食品卫生法》第40条第1款和该法实施细则第49条的规定，须接受健康检查的人员的诊断项目见附表。<2022年4月28日修订>\n② 根据《食品卫生法》第40条第1款和该法实施细则第49条规定须接受健康检查的人员，自上次健康检查之日起，每年至少接受一次健康检查。<2022年4月28日新增>\n③ 尽管有第2款的规定，如果食品药品安全部长官认定，由于《传染病防治法》规定的传染病疫情，导致执行机构无法按照第3条的规定正常进行健康检查，则可将健康检查延期至相关原因消除为止。<2022年4月28日新增>\n④ 根据第3款规定进行健康检查的宽限期和方法等事项，由食品药品安全部长确定并公布。<2022年4月28日新增>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":530,"end":713,"target_id":"fc9b53cc9d91e888776f4a8383049b3b7f551d26a2282c716a93093748a8d441","source_hash":"a0fe41c33c680da3b0a34463f778ce72650ec7d08fe29ff4f7f2acee6060dd6a","text":"第三条（健康检查的进行）  根据本规则进行的健康检查应当在《地方卫生法》规定的公共卫生中心（以下简称“公共卫生中心”）或《医疗服务法》规定的综合医院、医院或诊所（以下简称“医疗机构”）进行。但是，如果经营者提出要求，医疗机构的医务人员可以前往相关经营场所进行健康检查。<2018年12月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":713,"end":864,"target_id":"e6f1b308298b60d36301585afc09de92fd8f3b9921128fd5ba63ed8a320aecc4","source_hash":"ec4b8baf8a2e0f7906e6b9090cda5fa0a69548fa2c8283f2b307dae59e141217","text":"第四条（传染病患者等的报告）  根据第三条进行健康检查时发现传染病患者的，医疗机构负责人应当按照《传染病预防和管理法》第十一条的规定，向主管公共卫生中心负责人报告，并按照《医疗服务法》第二十二条的规定，记录和保存医疗记录等。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":864,"end":971,"target_id":"571af22684a8d6d94166377636eb33f6c98c00f9d2429af604a13ef6df797f38","source_hash":"c07c650837cfe8bbdeb23348a601767d2a9806afbc907cb251a979d45167d432","text":"第五条（费用）凡欲依第二条规定在公共卫生中心接受健康检查者，应当按该公共卫生中心所在地政府条例规定缴纳费用。<2018年3月28日修订；2023年11月22日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":971,"end":994,"target_id":"6a78940077bf49740ef15a34019039a843a7c3269fe891ce554745d5a0d5af46","source_hash":"87cb80a10111a7231907a1f14ee3e80f6e58560ebca5f469ef2988e86d40a996","text":"补充规定 <2013年3月23日第1015号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":994,"end":1024,"target_id":"172825742994f2a56def6a8acdb967adda0911c6fb06392ab541a40696e903c2","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1024,"end":1126,"target_id":"45442cb98ebaacdc1391cb4443d0d1ea2aa9d54ea36ae7ff86db81bca1b3de24","source_hash":"304a6485c8386c3ec90b926e398abcde6cd02dc61922f50c33ae731d0ad60b2b","text":"第二条（关于实施健康检查的过渡措施）在本规则实施时，已按照以前的“环卫部门等工作人员健康检查规则”接受过健康检查的人员，应视为已按照本规则接受过健康检查。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1126,"end":1278,"target_id":"91e57d16a7505fe12fd9bab77f5385dbe4320fa1d0614b59a0aa8675bcb47edd","source_hash":"75de62437063753bdc5240687dbec325e52027244533d4ff2568a6b1f85110f9","text":"第三条（与其他法律法规的关系）在本规则实施时，其他法律法规提及以前的“环卫工人健康检查规则”或其规定，而本规则中又有相应规定的，应当视为已援引本规则或者本规则的有关规定代替以前的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1278,"end":1357,"target_id":"671f86a70a702da78fed29396e699cf46045d18567c59e4498d47f85b848018f","source_hash":"b5bbca2ad1f0c70356ab13ea8e48cfd4f0e755eef7a0bb062c767ae701b92efc","text":"补充规定 <2018年3月28日第1444号>\n\n本规则自公布之日起生效。但是，第五条的修订规定自2018年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1357,"end":1402,"target_id":"4be21ea3687b455be6965d6e258f4fa136d1938d3c570d0acd5ca0d58fc3558f","source_hash":"fadd2358077b157f0cdbf5fd1f066608a347c83bc05d8ffcf5fe0b540bf74554","text":"补充规定 <2018年12月31日第1519号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1402,"end":1446,"target_id":"c3797ee4752be69ca18ada4b3381cbd9637629224c5e07341eaef36bb3ba9d8c","source_hash":"6e3d95c0c4f566f02b355a452a07cc675cdb842937bbcfcd2f5e99413c1859df","text":"补充规定 <第1804号，2022年4月28日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1446,"end":2395,"target_id":"143f741cf296553ac3fad1be0481de06353f17b179956ff749364b18e215e1b5","source_hash":"db1ea4dccd3b1a4aff85d517b6c29d843a311da9adc143afb737517de3885a0c","text":"增补文件（总理令，关于部分修订两项法案，包括《保健功能食品法》实施细则，以加强地方立法权和提升地方自治权）<2023年11月22日，第1916号>\n\n本规则自公布之日起生效。但是，第二条的修订规定自公布之日起一年后生效。\n\n健康检查项目（与第二条第一款有关）\n■ 食品卫生行业从业人员健康检查规则 [附表] <2022年4月28日修订>\n\n  健康检查项目（与第二条第一款有关）                                                \n\n┌───────────────────┬──────────────────┐\n\n│目标 │健康检查项目 │\n\n├───────────────────┼──────────────────┤\n\n│食品或食品添加剂（化学合成产品）│1.伤寒（食品卫生相关企业和机构）│\n\n│或不包括设备消毒器等消毒剂。│仅适用于单点餐厅的员工）│\n\n│D) 收集、制造、加工、烹制、储存· │2. 肺结核 │\n\n│直接从事运输或销售│3.传染性皮肤病（细菌性，例如麻风病）│\n\n│人。然而，在企业经营者或员工中，Wan │指皮肤病）│\n\n│전 포장된 식품 또는 식품첨가물을 운   │                                    │\n\n│恋爱或销售的人│ │\n\n│排除。│ │\n\n└───────────────────┴──────────────────┘"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00001","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746246","source_hash":"c61bac2859e8f9e4ad9f0dd870aa308cbbffb21e7f7322dc899db090423e0f94","text":"■ 食品卫生行业从业人员健康检查规则 [附表] <2022年4月28日修订>"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00002","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746247","source_hash":"ca72c86c4ad58cd8fb6dff54617c73b4949fb1ad125027552bfff71c93601d63","text":"健康检查项目（与第二条第一款有关）"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00003","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746248","source_hash":"8c609debc12c2cd08ebde99d0d4f80137bd62074c4821a4bcb3e3fdaec279f95","text":"目标"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00004","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746249","source_hash":"dfde97bffdc1d89054d23feb13a0a94499f55866b87bed20992af35898655604","text":"健康检查项目"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00005","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746250","source_hash":"50e82e13b4e9a51c15b721601a6ce4a42085ac9c5d7dbe1ab17b640128f67cff","text":"食品或食品添加剂（化学合成产品）"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00006","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746251","source_hash":"653af9ed2d4e3b1d44cd316c2f6b7308d24259631d3394846c668d73d6035376","text":"1. 伤寒（食品卫生相关企业和家庭"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00007","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746252","source_hash":"8feea1ea6af708d00e24b92e140de3feb803bd525c6d8cf235719bce91547cc0","text":"或设备消毒剂/灭菌器等。"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00008","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746253","source_hash":"e80e1f52de214fa7d94354d1e4b18940eb0572f4a315cc9c191f8044073c85a6","text":"（仅适用于食堂工作人员）"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00009","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746254","source_hash":"5aa8e0730634977c8d7e039573ce25b92e37b84245d65f162f46497f6549ec91","text":") 收集、制造、加工、烹饪、储存，"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00010","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746255","source_hash":"c33d17805af19b43d2300ecece815f12b866852bc7a0db96e4006ac6d29ebd78","text":"2. 肺结核"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00011","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746256","source_hash":"ff8bb1ccba3424f8c4bbb8e8186f90357797d66f195d8e337f8580790ee99614","text":"直接从事运输或销售"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00012","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746257","source_hash":"4654cc6a247550b0464e397f1e2df91d14c7f159693d533221775007033bcdfc","text":"3. 传染性皮肤病（细菌性）"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00013","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746258","source_hash":"11e458c25e1eb7f391a4188ddd658436c163c050a29ff43ad105c1320dc6783b","text":"人。然而，在企业经营者或员工中，Wan"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00014","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746259","source_hash":"c6173f0ca59e37e2edcf431a6d81c836da4cbca9c31ab41ab67b05e7055be1b0","text":"（指皮肤病）"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00015","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746260","source_hash":"ccf05d89287a028851ac4bb6c6519980edf0bb80d67d326d2cf1b20c3a5778fe","text":"在开始  之前运输包装食品或食品添加剂"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00016","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746261","source_hash":"c4b2a284c6dc8db4d3e108d0dce8a585c89a2fdbc918c13102093947022301ff","text":"从事销售或出售的人员"},{"id":"A37583-zh-00017","doc":"A37583","law_id":"kr-011797-256335-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2746262","source_hash":"93a172fe7a78ed8fd2f32399f911368a436648bf19145898558e88829eae657b","text":"和"}]}